    <sectiondef kind="user-defined">
      <header>Interactive mode</header>
      <description><para>Once a merge tree is specified, one can interactively perform the sampling by requesting that domino fill in the <ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1domino_1a3419fc2c9def4e8cfe47550df045e24c" kindref="member">Assignments</ref> for a given node of the merge tree from the assignments for the children. This can be useful for debugging Domino as well as for providing a distributed implementation.</para>
<para>For each method, you can pass max_states to limit how many states are generated.</para>
<para>You might want to just use <ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1domino_1a4570cce69f194985e23b710c3b5e18b4" kindref="member">load_leaf_assignments()</ref> and <ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1domino_1a200c71a273844cc32fd32f6a5eafa0aa" kindref="member">load_merged_assignments()</ref> instead. </para>
</description>
