    <briefdescription>
<para>Sample best solutions using Domino. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Note that if there are many solutions, the ConfigurationSet returned by get_sample() might be huge (in terms of memory usage) and slow to generate. The <ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1domino_1a3419fc2c9def4e8cfe47550df045e24c" kindref="member">Assignments</ref> returned by <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1DiscreteSampler_1a6f93b40d485b8617d38245bd6bf4ebae" kindref="member">get_sample_assignments()</ref> can be a lot smaller and faster. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
    <inheritancegraph>
